# INVWINBC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:BYCATR.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the items of
# TEST/KEYS/BYCAT.REQ: the categories at levels 1 and 2.  READER sees
# the categories and the items of SYS beside them, Edit, New and Delete
# grayed: INS, CTRL-E and DEL on a category, and INS in the items, are
# each refused in a message box, and ENTER opens SYS's items all the
# same.  CLERK, at level 2, renames SYS, which three items have: the
# list shows the name, and so do the items beside it, fetched again;
# its delete, asked first, is refused by the server, and that of MOBO,
# which no item has, is made, the next category selected.  View > Pane
# beside the list then shows the categories alone.  The end by Exit:
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/BYCATR.CFG is the settings file it leaves.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINBC.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks
# it.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-I T
S READER
K INS
S NONEW
K ENTER CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER F6 INS
S NOITEM
K ENTER ESC ENTER
S RALONE
K ALT-F L STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER ALT-I T CTRL-E
S FORM
T Computers
K ENTER
S RENAMED
K DEL
S ASK
K Y
S INUSE
K ENTER DOWN DEL Y
S DELETED
K ALT-V P
S ALONE
K ALT-F X
